{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>All about them strengthened</b> — in the hand of the stumbling and the poor: sheep and cattle." "<b>And beast</b> — to ride." "<b>Precious things</b> — possibly from מגדנים." "<b>Beside, upon all that was volunteered</b> — its meaning: the silver and the gold and the rest of the gifts were given separately, upon all that was volunteered as freewill offerings."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:34.507130240Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}